OL,3,GNEWSAKilled woman's family questions
OL,4,Afair, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a disabled woman stabbed
OL,7,Fto death by a psychotic stranger
OL,8,Fmoments after police let the killer
OL,9,Fwalk free have raised "fair" questions,
OL,10,Fa coroner has said.
OL,12,FAngela Lloyd, 56, was killed in her
OL,13,FNewton Aycliffe home in August 2025 by
OL,14,FPatricia Hewitt minutes after the
OL,15,F42-year-old had been spoken to by
OL,16,FDurham Police officers over her erratic
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,19,FHewitt was sentenced to an indefinite
OL,20,Fhospital detention order for diminished
OL,21,Fresponsibility manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
