OL,3,GNEWSAKilled woman's family questions
OL,4,Afair, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Durham coroner Crispin Oliver
OL,7,Fsaid the victim's family had made
OL,8,F"perfectly intelligent points" which
OL,9,Fwarranted investigation, but an inquest
OL,10,Fwould be delayed while the police
OL,11,Fwatchdog probed Durham Police's
OL,12,Factions.
